          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_2 Remark
            %p
              From the smooth geometric perspective on spin structures of remark
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TangentBundleModulatingMap"}
              one may also start with an
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/affine+connection"} affine connection
