            is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism"} isomorphism
            on the second
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+group"} homotopy group
            and hence by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hurewicz+theorem"} Hurewicz theorem
            is also an isomorphism on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology+group"} cohomology group
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi H
